     "solution_type": "detailed",
     "content_html": "Critically appraising each study for relevance and credibility is necessary to ensure the information provided is meaningful, trustworthy, and relevant. Information is considered trustworthy based on its confirmability and the reviewer’s confidence in the believability of the information produced in the literature."
